1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,000
Uncles and aunties,

2
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:02,279
See you tomorrow.

3
00:00:35,479 --> 00:00:37,119
I don't want to see you off tomorrow.

4
00:00:39,039 --> 00:00:40,479
Can I just sleep through it?

5
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,719
Yeah.

6
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:40,400
"A Winter Sun Wakes the Wind in Spring Hills' Dream"

7
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:47,800
(Episode 16: Beholding)

8
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:47,039
Microwave the rice for one minute.

9
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,240
And the dishes for three.

10
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:51,080
Don't microwave boiled
eggs directly, they'll explode.

11
00:03:08,159 --> 00:03:09,919
I figured you'd come.

12
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:13,360
Thank you for everything
you've done for him.

13
00:03:15,159 --> 00:03:16,159
Don't see him off.

14
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:19,400
Let him go fulfill his dream.

15
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:28,560
The social divide between you two
is harder to cross than life and death.

16
00:03:31,639 --> 00:03:34,759
Unless society progresses,

17
00:03:35,719 --> 00:03:39,960
or you're no longer you,

18
00:03:43,039 --> 00:03:44,159
and he's no longer him.

19
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,199
You took on a new role.

20
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:12,400
It must be challenging if you accepted it.

21
00:04:12,759 --> 00:04:14,999
It's okay, easier than the last one.

22
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,360
Cross-dressing again?

23
00:04:17,279 --> 00:04:20,040
Not exactly. I'm playing a fox spirit.

24
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:22,639
It's a story about a fox
spirit and a psychic priest.

25
00:04:23,639 --> 00:04:25,160
It's more of a genderless role.

26
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:27,520
The makeup and styling will
be a bit more androgynous.

27
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:28,800
A fantasy drama?

28
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:29,959
No.

29
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:31,240
An art-house film.

30
00:04:32,079 --> 00:04:33,160
A realistic theme.

31
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:34,759
Modern rituals.

32
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:37,399
Similar to the shamans in Langcheng.

33
00:04:47,763 --> 00:04:51,809
[To Changyang: Remember this, no
matter when you come back, I'll be there]

34
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,720
Hold on a second.

35
00:05:04,399 --> 00:05:05,399
About the costume,

36
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:11,360
his look could be a bit more trendy.

37
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,000
Got it.

38
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,920
Please turn down the AC a bit.

39
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:35,800
The social divide between us is
harder to cross than life and death.

40
00:05:36,199 --> 00:05:38,720
We both need to fulfill
our social identities.

41
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:40,800
When the day comes
to shed those identities,

42
00:05:41,160 --> 00:05:42,976
I'll come back to where
we started to find you.

43
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,639
If you're still there waiting for me.

44
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:47,720
Ah, let me do it.

45
00:05:52,519 --> 00:05:53,519
Say it again.

46
00:05:53,639 --> 00:05:54,759
You better remember this.

47
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:57,399
No matter when you come back, I'll be here.

48
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:08,720
Let me emphasize this one last time.

49
00:06:08,959 --> 00:06:11,199
No matter when you come back, I'll be here.

50
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,720
I want to see you off.

51
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,440
I don't want to just stand here and wait.

52
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:16,359
Because every time I stand there waiting,

53
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,599
it feels like you'll never come.

54
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,096
Go to the Yunhu Mountain observation deck.

55
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:20,560
The plane will fly over there.

56
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,160
Navigate to Yunhu Mountain.

57
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:45,000
Yunhu Mountain is a nice place.

58
00:06:45,399 --> 00:06:46,560
Having seen my lord,

59
00:06:46,639 --> 00:06:47,720
how could I not be joyful?

60
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:50,639
Did you see your lord today?

61
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:57,639
Oh man, where are you going, boss?

62
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:54,360
He's a star. He was in
an award-winning movie.

63
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:55,800
He cross-dressed in that one too.

64
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:59,120
Sister, it's trending.

65
00:07:59,639 --> 00:08:00,360
Director Li's new film.

66
00:08:00,361 --> 00:08:01,519
Lang Di cross-dresses again.

67
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:03,160
Is he still not back?

68
00:08:03,199 --> 00:08:04,720
Not yet, he's on his way.

69
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:08,160
Oh no, here we go again.

70
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,240
Boycott sissy culture.

71
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:12,000
Boycott men in women's clothing.

72
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:13,639
Bring back the tough guy era.

73
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,199
What the hell is this?

74
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:17,120
Lang Di isn't even wearing women's clothes.

75
00:08:17,399 --> 00:08:18,720
And even if he was,

76
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:21,680
Is it any of their business?

77
00:08:21,763 --> 00:08:24,303
[The funding for Director Li's "Snow
Drum Verse" has been withdrawn]

78
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:28,920
Sister.

79
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:30,759
Director Li spoke up for us.

80
00:08:32,256 --> 00:08:35,823
[A statement decrying the hate and patriarchal
values behind it regarding cross-dressing]

81
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:36,919
Hey, Director Li.

82
00:08:37,399 --> 00:08:39,360
I'm really sorry about what happened today.

83
00:08:39,639 --> 00:08:40,639
It's fine.

84
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,960
Our company will cover any losses incurred.

85
00:08:44,639 --> 00:08:47,439
The most important thing right
now is to control the public narrative.

86
00:08:49,039 --> 00:08:50,720
Let's meet at our company later then.

87
00:08:52,863 --> 00:08:54,896
[I guess the graphic is the
key art for "Snow Drum Verse"?]

88
00:08:59,559 --> 00:09:01,320
Director Li, I'm sorry.

89
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:04,000
My issues ended up dragging you into this.

90
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:07,960
Do I look like someone afraid
of being dragged into things?

91
00:09:11,639 --> 00:09:13,919
Jialan Shanying is injecting
new capital. We're shooting.

92
00:09:15,799 --> 00:09:17,519
Hurry up and issue a statement to cut ties.

93
00:09:19,159 --> 00:09:21,559
Are we really pulling the same
stunt we did seven years ago?

94
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:24,158
Investors have already
pulled out of the new film.

95
00:09:24,159 --> 00:09:25,679
Public opinion is still brewing.

96
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:28,599
If this keeps up, the higher-ups
will inevitably shut it down.

97
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:30,759
This situation is completely
out of our control.

98
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,960
Feng Qingtian's documentary is trending.

99
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:37,800
People are digging into Feng
Qingtian's sexual orientation.

100
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:39,159
And there's this photo.

101
00:09:40,756 --> 00:09:42,936
[Our son died because of this boy]

102
00:09:44,356 --> 00:09:49,396
[Literally every single topic
is about homosexuality]

103
00:09:59,369 --> 00:10:06,803
[The comments are all discussing Qinglang's
sexuality and his brother Qingtian]

104
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:09,720
If we distance ourselves from
him, we can still save ourselves.

105
00:10:10,519 --> 00:10:12,240
Your career is just starting to take off.

106
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:16,239
Didn't you team up with him again
just to use him as a stepping stone?

107
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:18,399
Fine. I'll issue a statement right now.

108
00:10:19,082 --> 00:10:21,056
[Please give the
dead their respect]

109
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:22,399
We can't say anything else.

110
00:10:23,679 --> 00:10:25,039
They're insulting my brother.

111
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:01,080
Do they have to dig up his
grave even after he's dead?

112
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:10,360
Did we commit some unforgivable sin?

113
00:11:10,799 --> 00:11:12,600
Shi Yuhao, what are you doing?

114
00:11:12,690 --> 00:11:14,750
[All the new topics relating to a voice
recording of Shi Yuhao having sex I guess?]

115
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:15,840
Well.

116
00:11:15,879 --> 00:11:16,879
(Feels good?)

117
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:20,176
I'll use my three burner accounts to
drop the recording in the Super Topic.

118
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,039
I'm asking you,

119
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:22,759
do you know what you're doing?

120
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,200
Smearing yourself?

121
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:27,840
Spilling the kettle of tea,
wile clearing the cup of tea.

122
00:11:31,279 --> 00:11:33,240
Shi Yuhao is trending now.

123
00:11:35,156 --> 00:11:38,216
[The rising topic is "Some
actor sleeps with lots of people"]

124
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:56,639
Day one, officially checking in.

125
00:11:58,279 --> 00:12:00,720
Protect yourself while I'm away.

126
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:04,200
My shares in my cousin's company

127
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:06,080
have already been transferred to your name.

128
00:12:07,759 --> 00:12:09,759
What else don't I know?

129
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:13,120
What's about to happen?

130
00:12:19,039 --> 00:12:20,119
That's a wrap!

131
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:23,240
Kill me, just kill me.

132
00:12:23,519 --> 00:12:24,918
That was so tough.

133
00:12:24,919 --> 00:12:26,359
Let's work together on the next one.

134
00:12:26,799 --> 00:12:29,199
Director Li, what theme are
you planning for your next film?

135
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,440
Cultivation.

136
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:34,278
My Chanel.

137
00:12:34,279 --> 00:12:37,239
My Hermès, my LV.

138
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:38,519
You know the password.

139
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:40,758
Your husband told me before he left.

140
00:12:40,759 --> 00:12:43,200
Take good care of yourself.

141
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:45,560
I'm heading back to Shangjing tomorrow.

142
00:12:45,639 --> 00:12:47,840
Eat well while you're here.

143
00:12:48,039 --> 00:12:49,839
And stop running off
into the forest so much.

144
00:12:50,039 --> 00:12:51,039
I know.

145
00:13:00,399 --> 00:13:01,879
Dad's verdict is out.

146
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:03,320
How is it?

147
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:04,840
Life imprisonment.

148
00:13:08,039 --> 00:13:09,039
We'll keep trying.

149
00:13:09,679 --> 00:13:10,840
Let nature take its course.

150
00:13:23,639 --> 00:13:25,240
Day 192, checking in.

151
00:13:25,639 --> 00:13:26,639
Today is special.

152
00:13:27,039 --> 00:13:28,679
No matter what day the calendar shows,

153
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:31,000
we've made it to day 192.

154
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:32,879
Decode this number for me.

155
00:13:33,039 --> 00:13:34,599
I'll check your answer when I get back.

156
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:23,080
Who the hell cut down my bamboo? Fuck!

157
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:29,720
The big star is back.

158
00:14:31,240 --> 00:14:32,879
A'Zha, thanks for your bamboo.

159
00:14:36,639 --> 00:14:39,320
Hey, I'm coming over for dinner tonight.

160
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:41,080
Sure.

161
00:14:43,799 --> 00:14:45,039
My bamboo...

162
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:54,600
I don't need help.

163
00:14:55,399 --> 00:14:57,639
I'm fine, I don't need help.

164
00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:17,720
This is nothing.

165
00:15:33,056 --> 00:15:35,516
[Day 397]

166
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:48,879
Go back to Shangjing.
Someone wants to see you.

167
00:15:53,399 --> 00:15:55,199
A'Zha, take me to Tianyi Airport.

168
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:56,200
That's far.

169
00:15:56,240 --> 00:15:57,039
I'll pay you.

170
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,199
Talking about money ruins the mood.

171
00:15:58,200 --> 00:15:59,440
Aren't you taking your luggage?

172
00:15:59,799 --> 00:16:00,799
I'm in a rush.

173
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:21,200
Coming back like this isn't unusual.

174
00:16:27,799 --> 00:16:29,039
Then why go?

175
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:32,120
People have to do reckless things sometimes

176
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:33,919
to grow some guts.

177
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:38,480
Trading my legs for some guts is worth it.

178
00:16:40,639 --> 00:16:42,039
He still can't come back, can he?

179
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:44,120
He's outstanding.

180
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:45,840
He graduated top of his class.

181
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:48,280
He asked me to return to
Shangjing to see you for him.

182
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:50,038
He said he's already said
everything he needed to say.

183
00:16:50,039 --> 00:16:51,176
He didn't ask me to pass on any messages.

184
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:52,679
Once a person leaves the Hunter School,

185
00:16:53,039 --> 00:16:55,039
every mission is a
matter of life and death.

186
00:16:55,480 --> 00:16:57,400
Having attachments makes
it even more dangerous.

187
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:16,079
Day 397, checking in.

188
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:17,319
Normally,

189
00:17:17,320 --> 00:17:19,255
I'd probably be standing
right beside you by now.

190
00:17:19,279 --> 00:17:20,399
If things aren't normal,

191
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:21,400
it's the unknown.

192
00:17:21,599 --> 00:17:22,879
To insure against the unknown,

193
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:24,200
I need to stock up on check-ins.

194
00:18:38,599 --> 00:18:40,359
Hand him the drum, please.

195
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:09,200
Hey, Lang Di, look at what we just shot.

196
00:19:10,799 --> 00:19:12,358
Wow, that's incredible.

197
00:19:12,359 --> 00:19:12,880
This angle is great.
Here, Lang Di.

198
00:19:16,039 --> 00:19:17,078
Help him fix his hair.

199
00:19:17,079 --> 00:19:18,079
Okay.

200
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:23,160
Hey, Lang Di.

201
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:25,039
It's a real pity this time.

202
00:19:25,559 --> 00:19:27,599
Director Li won Best
Director for Snow Drum Verse.

203
00:19:27,880 --> 00:19:29,720
We're just missing a
Best Actor award for you.

204
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:31,999
The character in Snow Drum
Verse is a bit like Ye Xiaoe.

205
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:33,200
It's normal not to win.

206
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:36,359
Let's shoot some commercial
films, something lighter.

207
00:19:37,599 --> 00:19:38,599
Send over the scripts.

208
00:19:38,759 --> 00:19:40,759
Keep next year's schedule
open for Director Li.

209
00:19:40,839 --> 00:19:42,119
He's going to shoot Cultivation.

210
00:19:42,960 --> 00:19:45,880
If a film like this isn't shot well, it
just feels pretentious and empty.

211
00:19:46,839 --> 00:19:48,000
Look who's the expert.

212
00:19:49,839 --> 00:19:53,400
My dear grandson, the movie
you shot this time is truly beautiful!

213
00:19:54,640 --> 00:19:56,559
Grandma, can you even understand it?

214
00:19:57,839 --> 00:19:59,200
Why wouldn't I understand it?

215
00:20:01,359 --> 00:20:03,400
The year your dad passed away,

216
00:20:03,480 --> 00:20:05,759
I invited a master to our house.

217
00:20:06,079 --> 00:20:08,439
Those mystical things,

218
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:10,160
you really can't just dismiss them.

219
00:20:11,359 --> 00:20:12,640
What did the master say?

220
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:15,640
He didn't say a word.

221
00:20:15,759 --> 00:20:17,815
He just came in and started
kowtowing, bang, bang, bang.

222
00:20:17,839 --> 00:20:19,558
And after he finished, he just ran away.

223
00:20:19,559 --> 00:20:20,960
Hahaha, ran away?

224
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:23,200
Look, look.

225
00:20:23,201 --> 00:20:24,640
How beautiful this shot is.

226
00:20:24,759 --> 00:20:26,000
Yeah, it's really nice.

227
00:20:28,880 --> 00:20:30,079
This spring,

228
00:20:30,240 --> 00:20:31,519
I came back again.

229
00:20:32,279 --> 00:20:33,639
And offered our secret base

230
00:20:33,640 --> 00:20:35,680
to my new film, Mountain Dwelling.

231
00:20:36,480 --> 00:20:38,440
Because the theme is
about spiritual cultivation,

232
00:20:38,839 --> 00:20:40,720
I was finally willing
to bring outsiders here.

233
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:45,039
You've checked in for 1,470 days.

234
00:20:45,519 --> 00:20:49,480
How much time did you
give yourself before you left?

235
00:20:50,039 --> 00:20:51,775
If you can never come
back in this lifetime,

236
00:20:51,799 --> 00:20:53,440
can you really check in for a lifetime?

237
00:20:55,039 --> 00:20:56,440
The year Dad had his accident,

238
00:20:56,599 --> 00:20:58,599
the name Xu Changyang disappeared.

239
00:20:59,480 --> 00:21:02,400
How am I supposed to tell you that I've been
waiting for you all this time right here?

240
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:05,400
I know you can't have too many attachments,

241
00:21:05,799 --> 00:21:07,640
but letting you know I'm waiting for you,

242
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:11,359
could it force you to survive
in life-or-death moments?

243
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:13,840
To save your last breath
to come back and see me.

244
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:37,500
(Feng Qinglang wins Best Actor at the 93rd Golden
Leaf Awards for the film Mountain Dwelling)

245
00:21:37,599 --> 00:21:39,679
The first person I want to thank is my

246
00:21:39,680 --> 00:21:41,999
mother of three lifetimes, Ms. Xing Lan.

247
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:43,879
She was the one who led me down this path,

248
00:21:43,880 --> 00:21:46,799
and she was the one who helped
me win the first award of my life.

249
00:21:47,920 --> 00:21:51,119
Next, I want to thank Director
Li of Mountain Dwelling,

250
00:21:51,240 --> 00:21:52,839
for giving me such natural guidance.

251
00:21:52,920 --> 00:21:54,079
Producer Jialin,

252
00:21:54,279 --> 00:21:57,519
our grumpy sister did a great
job not rushing us on set today.

253
00:21:57,640 --> 00:22:00,239
I also want to thank my
cinematographer, Teacher Yinsong.

254
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:01,119
I just want to clarify,

255
00:22:01,160 --> 00:22:02,439
I don't have an idol's ego,

256
00:22:02,440 --> 00:22:04,255
so you don't always have
to shoot my left profile.

257
00:22:04,279 --> 00:22:06,440
Although I admit my left
profile does look better.

258
00:22:09,079 --> 00:22:10,160
In this last minute,

259
00:22:12,960 --> 00:22:14,759
standing here today,

260
00:22:14,839 --> 00:22:16,440
I want to announce to the whole world

261
00:22:16,680 --> 00:22:19,559
that Feng Qinglang is retiring
from the entertainment industry.

262
00:22:24,920 --> 00:22:28,880
The photo behind me was
taken in the spring when I was 29.

263
00:22:28,920 --> 00:22:31,279
The people in the photo
are me and my boyfriend.

264
00:22:31,480 --> 00:22:33,039
In the hearts of my fans,

265
00:22:33,160 --> 00:22:34,240
I am a star.

266
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:35,838
But in my heart,

267
00:22:35,839 --> 00:22:36,839
he is a hero.

268
00:22:37,079 --> 00:22:38,079
My hero.

269
00:22:38,440 --> 00:22:39,680
I'm coming home.

270
00:22:44,640 --> 00:22:46,039
Are you crazy?

271
00:22:46,079 --> 00:22:48,559
You're retiring and coming out?

272
00:22:49,279 --> 00:22:51,160
Ah, I'm going to lose my mind!

273
00:22:51,279 --> 00:22:52,960
Retiring is one thing,

274
00:22:53,039 --> 00:22:54,279
but coming out too?

275
00:23:06,680 --> 00:23:07,680
Well done.

276
00:23:45,160 --> 00:23:46,160
I'm sorry.

277
00:23:46,440 --> 00:23:49,240
I still can't show your photo to everyone.

278
00:23:50,079 --> 00:23:51,680
Not because I lack courage,

279
00:23:52,279 --> 00:23:53,679
but because our courage

280
00:23:53,680 --> 00:23:55,240
can only grow within the rules.

281
00:23:57,039 --> 00:23:58,720
I've been pretty bold already, haven't I?

282
00:24:02,559 --> 00:24:03,798
Your comrade said

283
00:24:03,799 --> 00:24:06,640
trading a pair of legs
for courage is worth it.

284
00:24:08,200 --> 00:24:10,798
Today, I'm using the rest of my life

285
00:24:10,799 --> 00:24:14,480
to trade for the day that tea cake
can be opened, and it's worth it too.

286
00:24:20,640 --> 00:24:22,319
Keep that tea cake from yesterday for me.

287
00:24:24,640 --> 00:24:25,680
Until when?

288
00:24:43,880 --> 00:24:45,119
Lang Di retired.

289
00:24:46,319 --> 00:24:47,640
He should've retired ages ago.

290
00:24:47,839 --> 00:24:50,279
He's not short on money, who'd
want to stay in that hellhole?

291
00:24:51,039 --> 00:24:52,480
If you all retire,

292
00:24:52,519 --> 00:24:56,039
how is my mom's media company
supposed to survive? Film ghosts?

293
00:24:56,799 --> 00:24:58,879
Just use AI, it acts better
than real people anyway.

294
00:24:58,880 --> 00:25:00,600
And you don't have to worry about scandals.

295
00:25:01,640 --> 00:25:03,279
Zhiyuan, show me the trending topics.

296
00:25:06,839 --> 00:25:09,039
Coming out publicly at an award ceremony.

297
00:25:12,200 --> 00:25:13,640
If my mom hadn't stopped you,

298
00:25:13,920 --> 00:25:15,799
would you have come out last year too?

299
00:25:17,400 --> 00:25:18,440
He doesn't need to.

300
00:25:18,640 --> 00:25:19,679
Heaven knows, earth knows,

301
00:25:19,680 --> 00:25:20,879
and as long as we know, that's enough.

302
00:25:20,880 --> 00:25:22,400
No need to come out for others to see.

303
00:25:34,240 --> 00:25:35,359
Has he gone home yet?

304
00:25:36,000 --> 00:25:37,000
Not yet.

305
00:25:38,799 --> 00:25:40,000
He will.

306
00:25:59,423 --> 00:26:01,643
[Break Ground: I want you to live
peacefully in the aroma of time~]

307
00:26:06,803 --> 00:26:08,583
["Break Ground" suddenly
floating up in cursive]

308
00:26:38,000 --> 00:26:39,120
Congratulations on retiring.

309
00:26:40,240 --> 00:26:41,559
Didn't you retire too?

310
00:26:46,039 --> 00:26:47,558
Thank you for what happened that year.

311
00:26:47,559 --> 00:26:49,558
I never said thanks. I
can't hold my liquor,

312
00:26:49,559 --> 00:26:50,839
so I'll use tea instead of wine.

313
00:26:52,400 --> 00:26:54,800
Actually, I never really understood
what happened that year.

314
00:26:55,680 --> 00:26:57,558
Hey, you've been studying
philosophy with Sister Lan for so long,

315
00:26:57,559 --> 00:26:59,559
why don't you analyze it for me?

316
00:27:00,160 --> 00:27:02,000
Let me do an impression
of Sister Lan for you.

317
00:27:03,920 --> 00:27:04,920
Yuhao,

318
00:27:08,359 --> 00:27:09,880
to put it simply,

319
00:27:10,039 --> 00:27:12,759
this world is made of yin and yang.

320
00:27:13,680 --> 00:27:15,640
Where there is light, there is darkness.

321
00:27:16,079 --> 00:27:18,640
Two opposing things
existing at the same time,

322
00:27:18,759 --> 00:27:19,759
that is the Dao.

323
00:27:19,920 --> 00:27:21,720
The Dao that many people cannot comprehend.

324
00:27:22,400 --> 00:27:23,680
Sister Lan is really something.

325
00:27:24,119 --> 00:27:25,639
Someone who truly understands the Dao.

326
00:27:26,759 --> 00:27:29,519
I used to always hear her
going on and on about the Dao,

327
00:27:30,160 --> 00:27:31,558
and I'd think to myself, damn,

328
00:27:31,559 --> 00:27:33,880
this person is so full of herself.

329
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:36,880
Now I realize the idiot was me.

330
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:38,200
She's a badass,

331
00:27:38,960 --> 00:27:40,079
not a dumbass.

332
00:27:40,799 --> 00:27:41,920
Watch your mouth.

333
00:27:43,000 --> 00:27:44,319
Just joking around.

334
00:27:45,880 --> 00:27:48,720
That's why Sister Lan never looks
at things in terms of right or wrong.

335
00:27:48,799 --> 00:27:51,160
This world inherently has
many different perspectives.

336
00:27:51,359 --> 00:27:52,799
Today you take this stance,

337
00:27:53,000 --> 00:27:54,519
and this stance is right.

338
00:27:54,559 --> 00:27:56,055
Tomorrow you switch to another stance,

339
00:27:56,079 --> 00:27:58,599
then today's stance needs to be redefined.

340
00:27:58,880 --> 00:28:00,160
It becomes wrong.

341
00:28:01,880 --> 00:28:04,000
Sister Lan transcended
these stances a long time ago.

342
00:28:06,960 --> 00:28:10,559
Your old flame hasn't come back yet?

343
00:28:12,119 --> 00:28:13,119
He's too wild.

344
00:28:16,519 --> 00:28:17,519
True.

345
00:28:18,480 --> 00:28:20,240
Someone who could elope with you.

346
00:28:25,279 --> 00:28:26,279
Sorry about that.

347
00:28:34,240 --> 00:28:36,079
Hey, what are you performing next week?

348
00:28:37,480 --> 00:28:38,559
Moths to a Flame.

349
00:28:39,119 --> 00:28:41,440
Everyone on the internet is like a moth.

350
00:28:41,839 --> 00:28:43,440
Their comments are like spells,

351
00:28:43,559 --> 00:28:45,680
sealing them within the
storm of public opinion.

352
00:28:46,039 --> 00:28:47,440
Wherever a fire starts,

353
00:28:47,680 --> 00:28:49,119
the moths will fly towards it.

354
00:28:49,319 --> 00:28:51,240
The bigger the fire, the
more moths there are.

355
00:28:51,279 --> 00:28:52,680
Eventually, the fire goes out,

356
00:28:52,720 --> 00:28:53,759
and the moths die.

357
00:28:53,920 --> 00:28:54,960
Mutual destruction.

358
00:28:56,920 --> 00:28:58,240
But in reality,

359
00:28:59,640 --> 00:29:00,759
the moths don't die.

360
00:29:02,359 --> 00:29:04,359
They just fly towards the next fire.

361
00:29:06,279 --> 00:29:07,759
Their souls died a long time ago.

362
00:30:07,160 --> 00:30:08,320
I'm not turning on donations.

363
00:30:08,480 --> 00:30:09,759
Thank you all for tuning in.

364
00:30:12,233 --> 00:30:15,440
For next week's live performance,
you're all welcome to tune in to my stream.

365
00:30:27,200 --> 00:30:29,440
I once wanted to live to be 45.

366
00:30:30,039 --> 00:30:32,799
It's a pity I let myself down.

367
00:30:36,363 --> 00:30:39,870
[Breaking Ground Puppet Theatre]

368
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:49,700
(Moths to a Flame)

369
00:31:09,400 --> 00:31:12,240
Look at the trending topics,
Shi Yuhao committed suicide.

370
00:31:12,400 --> 00:31:14,095
He died in the middle
of the night yesterday.

371
00:31:14,119 --> 00:31:16,920
The police announced his time of
death was the same as Sister Lan's.

372
00:31:17,400 --> 00:31:19,518
He even posted the screen recording
from before Sister Lan's car crash.

373
00:31:19,519 --> 00:31:21,920
Xing Lan, do you really have
to push people to their deaths?

374
00:31:22,039 --> 00:31:24,078
Didn't you say you
wouldn't release that video?

375
00:31:24,079 --> 00:31:25,000
You broke your promise.
You'll die a horrible death.

376
00:31:25,839 --> 00:31:28,119
Shi Yuhao, watch your mouth.

377
00:31:28,240 --> 00:31:29,079
Sister Lan is driving.

378
00:31:29,080 --> 00:31:30,656
If you want to pick a fight, come at me.

379
00:31:30,680 --> 00:31:31,680
Brother Guo...

380
00:31:32,039 --> 00:31:33,278
The whole internet is full of dirt on me.

381
00:31:33,279 --> 00:31:34,680
How do you expect me to calm down?

382
00:31:34,839 --> 00:31:36,598
You damn well know it's dirt on you!

383
00:31:36,599 --> 00:31:38,959
If you're so capable, don't
create dirt in the first place!

384
00:31:39,039 --> 00:31:40,039
Yuhao,

385
00:31:42,920 --> 00:31:44,880
Yuhao, I'm driving right now.

386
00:31:45,000 --> 00:31:47,400
I can't check what dirt
you're talking about.

387
00:31:47,599 --> 00:31:48,880
Just calm down for a second.

388
00:31:49,240 --> 00:31:51,880
I'll handle this once I
get to where I'm going.

389
00:31:52,279 --> 00:31:54,839
I believe there must be a misunderstanding.

390
00:31:55,240 --> 00:31:57,199
Even though I didn't release the video,

391
00:31:57,200 --> 00:31:58,880
it definitely has something to do with me.

392
00:31:59,039 --> 00:32:00,839
So I won't just sit back and do nothing.

393
00:32:01,680 --> 00:32:04,279
I'll also compensate you
for any losses you've suffered.

394
00:32:05,599 --> 00:32:09,480
Yuhao, I hope you can calm down
and listen to me for a moment.

395
00:32:11,079 --> 00:32:14,160
Back when I cast you and Qinglang in
Jialin's and my first film,

396
00:32:14,203 --> 00:32:15,530
[All the comments are blaming
him for killing Shi Haoyu]

397
00:32:15,599 --> 00:32:16,838
it was as if the four of us

398
00:32:16,839 --> 00:32:18,519
walked into a web of cause and effect.

399
00:32:18,695 --> 00:32:20,015
On this web,

400
00:32:20,039 --> 00:32:21,599
we could go in many directions.

401
00:32:22,039 --> 00:32:23,598
We could move together like chess pieces

402
00:32:23,599 --> 00:32:24,920
to the edge of the web,

403
00:32:25,039 --> 00:32:26,599
and break free from its constraints.

404
00:32:26,616 --> 00:32:27,576
[ALl the comments are cursing
Qinglang into his next life]

405
00:32:27,640 --> 00:32:28,640
Unfortunately,

406
00:32:29,200 --> 00:32:31,399
we only walked a short distance together

407
00:32:31,400 --> 00:32:33,319
before you headed in
the opposite direction.

408
00:32:33,839 --> 00:32:35,599
No one can predict the outcome.

409
00:32:36,039 --> 00:32:37,439
Maybe tomorrow food will

410
00:32:37,440 --> 00:32:39,319
fly into the web for us to eat.

411
00:32:39,343 --> 00:32:39,989
["Feng Qinglang is
shameless for coming out"]

412
00:32:40,045 --> 00:32:42,325
Or maybe the web will
be battered by the rain

413
00:32:42,599 --> 00:32:43,599
and eventually collapse.

414
00:32:44,480 --> 00:32:45,919
Even getting to where we are today,

415
00:32:45,920 --> 00:32:48,799
I can't say whether your departure
back then was right or wrong.

416
00:32:49,240 --> 00:32:51,400
Your path can only be
forged by your own feet.

417
00:32:52,200 --> 00:32:53,599
The same goes for Qinglang's path.

418
00:32:54,119 --> 00:32:55,640
He reached where he is today,

419
00:32:55,839 --> 00:32:57,106
but you can't say he's the absolute best.

420
00:32:57,123 --> 00:32:58,350
["Give us back the love we gave for our couple!"]

421
00:32:58,413 --> 00:33:01,292
And you can't say you're a failure
for where you are today either.

422
00:33:01,599 --> 00:33:02,719
No matter what,

423
00:33:02,720 --> 00:33:04,000
you are who you are.

424
00:33:04,720 --> 00:33:07,239
Looking back and acknowledging
that the path behind you

425
00:33:07,240 --> 00:33:08,640
was walked by you, step by step.

426
00:33:08,680 --> 00:33:09,999
Having that kind of courage

427
00:33:10,000 --> 00:33:11,319
makes you the best.

428
00:33:33,839 --> 00:33:34,839
Sister Lan,

429
00:33:35,720 --> 00:33:39,119
can I finally say we're even?

430
00:35:36,039 --> 00:35:37,039
I'm back.

431
00:35:38,920 --> 00:35:40,320
I've left the industry.

432
00:35:40,800 --> 00:35:42,039
I've retired.

433
00:36:14,719 --> 00:36:17,599
Hey, don't eat that raw! You'll see things!

434
00:36:20,400 --> 00:36:22,439
Ugh, I told you not to eat it raw!

435
00:36:22,440 --> 00:36:23,480
Are you crazy?

436
00:36:24,840 --> 00:36:26,119
It's the same either way.

437
00:36:27,239 --> 00:36:28,239
The same how?

438
00:36:28,719 --> 00:36:29,920
Seeing things.

439
00:36:31,599 --> 00:36:34,679
Qi Haoyu, how much of this
month's revenue did you stash away?

440
00:36:35,400 --> 00:36:37,719
Hahaha, not much!

441
00:36:38,239 --> 00:36:40,239
Qi Haoyu, stop right there!

442
00:37:41,386 --> 00:37:43,966
["Spring Flame"]

443
00:38:11,840 --> 00:38:12,840
Ah!

444
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:14,198
You got married and didn't invite me?

445
00:38:14,199 --> 00:38:15,320
We can't be friends anymore.

446
00:38:15,920 --> 00:38:16,920
Not even a heads-up?

447
00:38:17,000 --> 00:38:18,960
Were you afraid I couldn't
afford a wedding gift?

448
00:38:19,639 --> 00:38:20,959
Your wedding can't be this simple.

449
00:38:20,960 --> 00:38:22,679
I'll pay to throw you guys a proper one.

450
00:38:23,159 --> 00:38:24,119
Love is compassion.
Compassion is love.

451
00:38:25,120 --> 00:38:29,039
A love that has weathered
the storm will last a lifetime.

452
00:38:29,079 --> 00:38:30,999
I'm totally shipping you two in real life!

453
00:38:31,000 --> 00:38:33,760
You two better not break up!

454
00:38:34,000 --> 00:38:35,880
How could you get married in secret?

455
00:38:36,119 --> 00:38:37,400
I'm going to throw a fit!

456
00:38:37,840 --> 00:38:39,158
You two are having a wedding.

457
00:38:39,159 --> 00:38:40,320
Are two bamboo shoots enough?

458
00:38:42,639 --> 00:38:44,000
Seeing you find true love,

459
00:38:44,239 --> 00:38:45,279
Makes me so happy for you.

460
00:38:45,480 --> 00:38:46,759
Making someone wait five years for you...

461
00:38:46,760 --> 00:38:47,639
Only you could pull that off.

462
00:38:47,640 --> 00:38:49,559
And you, you just
waited around like a fool?

463
00:38:49,599 --> 00:38:51,440
Believe in love, and hold on to it.

464
00:38:51,800 --> 00:38:52,840
Wishing you both the best.

465
00:40:46,082 --> 00:40:52,182
This film is dedicated to the boundless
spring mountains and to those who love.
